---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Cookies & Website Measurement"
  description="Information about essential website technology, Google Ads measurement and how to change your cookie preferences."
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container prose">
      <h1>Cookies & website measurement</h1>
      <h2>Essential technology</h2>
      <p>
        We store your cookie preference in your browser’s local storage under
        ses-consent-v1. Cloudflare Turnstile protects enquiry forms against
        automated submissions and processes technical browser information for
        that purpose.
      </p>
      <h2>Optional Google Ads measurement</h2>
      <p>
        If you accept measurement, the site loads the existing Google Ads tag.
        It measures actions such as starting and successfully submitting an
        enquiry, clicking a service enquiry link, and clicking a phone or email
        link. Personalised advertising consent remains denied.
      </p>
      <p>
        If you reject optional measurement, this implementation does not load
        the Google Ads tag or send these events. Changing your preference stops
        subsequent optional events; it does not erase information already sent.
      </p>
      <h2>Change your choice</h2>
      <p>
        Use Cookie preferences in the footer to review your choice. You can also
        remove stored website data through your browser settings.
      </p>
      <!-- OWNER TODO: Maintain a production cookie inventory after deployment and whenever analytics configuration changes. -->
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
